  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-06-18T13:08:36.947Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We want to host a large event in our SDK3 world where we live-stream content from \"safe\" domains like Youtube or Twitch and also show static content from Youtube, Vimeo, Dropbox or Drive etc. so that people can enjoy the same event from multiple instances together.\nSince video players disappeared in SDK3, we don't know how to solve this now. \nI don't think a \"security thread\" would still exist if you give us a video/stream player that is limited to well-known domains like Youtube, Twitch, Dropbox, Drive etc. as a temporary solution and this would already help us a lot until video players are back. \n\nEven just having a video player that is limited to only Youtube would solve our issue completely.",
